	(text "Connectors\nJ_UI (XH 12) to the front panel: SPI display uses SCK/MOSI/CS/DC; an I2C OLED only\nSCK = SCL and MOSI = SDA (fit R105/R106 on the MCU sheet). Buttons pull to GND on the panel.\nJ_UI pin 12 and J_LED (XH 3) carry the status LED through R501 330R: a plain LED wires\nstraight to LED/GND (panel header or J_LED), or an SK6812 on J_LED (power from VBAT_SW).\nPin orders are the contract with the front panel (hardware/README.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
